  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is about increasing knowledge, including stakeholders awareness and young researchers capacity by strengthening NORCE and UFSC research on global food systems, the use of biotechnology to food production and how such systems adhere to domestic and international food and biodiversity treaties. The expected impact of this project is to have policy and regulatory biosafety framework in place for new gene-edited organisms aligned with the UN Sustainability Goals</narrative>
  </description>
